{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kody, a modern gym rat gets zapped by strange lightning and time-travels to 1898.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A BARA, choices matter, alternate history, Visual Novel Musical set in the East Coast of USA.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on a visual novel engine with RPG elements.  <br>Choices matter! Not only must Kody decide if he should speak of the future, but also must decide which details he will share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The potential of 4 love interests or enemies await. LGBTQ+ with romance options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game installment covers a full day in Kody's adventure. This is Day 1 of 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~15 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced characters with separate volume control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex flow-chart leads to many multiple endings by the end of Day 8, possibly even a thruple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kody be smart enough to navigate the past? Will he end up in a Sanatorium? Or, will he be a Himbo?\u00a0 Player choices matter...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589780?t=1754509687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/fb5e98432003fd148eb1c93afffcf044354ae002/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754509687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/424d504d89cd1307ca020b9979118ecab1954ac5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754509687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/424d504d89cd1307ca020b9979118ecab1954ac5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754509687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3622020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kody, a modern gym rat gets zapped by strange lightning and time-travels to 1898.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A BARA, choices matter, alternate history, Visual Novel Musical set in the East Coast of USA.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on a visual novel engine with RPG elements.  <br>Choices matter! Not only must Kody decide if he should speak of the future, but also must decide which details he will share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The potential of 4 love interests or enemies await. LGBTQ+ with romance options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game installment covers a full day in Kody's adventure. This is Day 1 of 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~15 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced characters with separate volume control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex flow-chart leads to many multiple endings by the end of Day 8, possibly even a thruple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kody be smart enough to navigate the past? Will he end up in a Sanatorium? Or, will he be a Himbo?\u00a0 Player choices matter...</p>","developers":["Jaxx Cordd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/0fd0512c4838000aa5ee3dcc58fa49bd2c97b957/header.jpg?t=1754509687","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3589